WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.267
A 19 second video

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.302
of Ukrainian President

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.269
Volodymyr Zelensky

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.305
has gotten millions of views on Twitter.

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:06.306
The viral video

00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:07.007
shows Zelensky

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.308
speaking at a press conference

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:10.510
on the anniversary of Russia's invasion.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.912
And it sure sounds from this short clip

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:15.415
like he made a dramatic declaration

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:18.118
that Americans have to fight in Ukraine.

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:21.988
The US will have to send their sons

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:23.356
and daughters

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:25.892
exactly the same way as we are

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:27.927
sending their sons and daughters to war.

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:30.130
And they will have to fight

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.164
because it's

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:32.465
nature that we're talking about

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.901
and they will be dying and God forbid,

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:37.303
because it's a horrible thing.

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:38.905
Critics of American financial

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:39.773
and military support

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:40.306
for Ukraine

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:42.042
have reacted furiously to this clip

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.643
and shared it on social media.

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:45.011
They include Republican Senator

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:46.413
Mike Lee of Utah

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.614
and Monica Crowley,

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:49.315
a former Trump administration

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:51.051
Treasury Department spokesperson.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:51.851
Crowley wrote.

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.987
Zelensky now directly threatening us

00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:55.989
and claiming American sons and daughters

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:58.558
will have to fight and die for Ukraine.

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:02.128
However, Zelensky did not actually make

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:02.896
that claim.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.130
This 19 second video

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.499
takes him way out of context.

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:07.734
The full clip shows

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.602
that he wasn't talking about Americans

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.438
fighting in Ukraine at all.

00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:13.373
Here is what really happened.

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.340
Zelensky was asked

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.842
about what he'd say to Americans

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.310
who think the US is providing

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.079
too much support for Ukraine.

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:20.747
He first thanked the American people,

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.082
President Biden and Congress

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.016
for their support.

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:24.918
He urged Americans to see Ukrainians

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.252
as similar to themselves.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.153
He urged the U.S.

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:27.787
not to give up

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:29.689
its leadership position in the world.

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:30.990
And then he said this

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:33.993
The US is never

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:34.928
going to give

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:37.964
up on the need to member states

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:39.165
if it happens

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:43.436
so that Ukraine, due to various opinions

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:46.372
and we can and depleting of assistance

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:50.710
loses.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.279
Russia is going to enter

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.649
Baltic states, native member states

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:57.917
and then

00:01:57.917 --> 00:02:01.054
the US will have to send their sons

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:02.455
and daughters

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:04.991
exactly the same way as we are

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:06.993
sending their sons and daughters to war.

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:10.029
And they will have to fight because it's

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.564
nature that we're talking about

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:13.032
and they will be dying.

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:13.967
God forbid,

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:16.369
because it's a horrible thing to

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:20.273
I wish them

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.008
peace and Ukrainian

00:02:22.008 --> 00:02:24.043
support to the United States.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.246
People are free to criticize

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:28.281
that actual comment from Zelensky,

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:29.849
but he was clearly not saying

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:30.316
the US

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:32.752
military should fight on Ukrainian soil.

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:34.854
He was saying the US would have to fight

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:35.989
in other countries.

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.056
NATO's countries

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:38.758
the US has formally committed

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:39.726
to help defend

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:42.595
if Russia invaded those countries later.

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:44.063
So as always,

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:45.698
when you come across a sensational

00:02:45.698 --> 00:02:47.767
but short clip on social media,

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:49.169
it's always a good idea

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:52.505
to look for the extended footage to

